l":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Project, step, and reason\n\nGlobal development workflow item G6d. Platform decision 8 gives the platform its own GitHub board, so platform work can be seen without the site's issues mixed in. Under decision 19 boards follow products, so the Platform product needs a [products] entry and keepbreathing-infra needs to name it. The board exists as sh4i-yurei project 3.\n\n### What changes\n\nIn tools/workflow/workflow.toml, add \"Platform\" = { owner = \"sh4i-yurei\", number = 3 } under [products], and change keepbreathing-infra's [boards] line from \"keepbreath.ing\" to \"Platform\". The site and the contact API stay on keepbreath.ing.\n\n### Done when\n\nA dry run of issue.py open for a keepbreathing-infra issue file plans project item-add 3, one for a keepbreathing issue file still plans project item-add 1, and every existing test passes.\n","closed_by":{"login":"sh4i-yurei","id":232996764,"node_id":"U_kgDODeM_nA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232996764?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei","html_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://ap